This `num_tokens` can exceed the cudagraph capture limit, and then the draft slot cost becomes inaccurate. You can probably fix this by instead deriving `num_reqs` from the `num_tokens` in the capture size like:
```
for num_tokens in capture_sizes:
    if num_tokens % query_len:
        continue
    num_reqs = num_tokens // query_len
    if num_reqs > max_num_reqs:
        break
    ...
```

